<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 02:58:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>随着股票敞口接近上限，印度养老基金转向债券</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/india-pension-funds-pivot-to-bonds-as-equity-exposure-nears-cap</link><description>随着印度最大的养老基金接近股票投资的监管门槛，印度最大的养老基金正将更多资金投入政府债券，而当地股市也从惨烈的抛售中反弹。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/india-pension-funds-pivot-to-bonds-as-equity-exposure-nears-cap'&gt;随着股票敞口接近上限，印度养老基金转向债券&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：India Pension Funds Pivot to Bonds as Equity Exposure Nears Cap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/india-pension-funds-pivot-to-bonds-as-equity-exposure-nears-cap</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 01:30:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>澳大利亚击败中国在所罗门群岛的太平洋立足点</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/australia-aims-to-sign-another-deal-to-block-china-in-pacific</link><description>澳大利亚与所罗门群岛签署了一项新条约，旨在阻止中国进入太平洋，部分扭转了北京三年前在该地区取得的进展，令美国及其盟友感到震惊。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/australia-aims-to-sign-another-deal-to-block-china-in-pacific'&gt;澳大利亚击败中国在所罗门群岛的太平洋立足点&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Australia Edges China Out of Pacific Foothold in Solomon Islands&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/australia-aims-to-sign-another-deal-to-block-china-in-pacific</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 09:01:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>澳大利亚的通货膨胀证明了澳大利亚央行的鹰派政策立场</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/australian-inflation-accelerates-even-after-rba-rate-hikes</link><description>澳大利亚10月份核心通胀意外加速，凸显了经济中持续存在的价格压力，并证实了储备银行官员的鹰派评论。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/australian-inflation-accelerates-even-after-rba-rate-hikes'&gt;澳大利亚的通货膨胀证明了澳大利亚央行的鹰派政策立场&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Australia’s Hot Inflation Vindicates RBA’s Hawkish Policy Stance&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/australian-inflation-accelerates-even-after-rba-rate-hikes</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:32:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</link><description>由于交易商权衡供应增加的迹象与霍尔木兹海峡周围船只遭受的袭击升级，油价下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25'&gt;11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 25&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:06:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>日元债券发行取消后乐天信用风险飙升</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/rakuten-credit-risk-surges-after-yen-bond-offering-scrapped</link><description>乐天集团 (Rakuten Group Inc.) 取消在债券市场筹集约 1500 亿日元（合 9.42 亿美元）的计划后，该公司的信用风险飙升至 2025 年 4 月以来的最高水平。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/rakuten-credit-risk-surges-after-yen-bond-offering-scrapped'&gt;日元债券发行取消后乐天信用风险飙升&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Rakuten Credit Risk Surges After Yen Bond Offering Scrapped&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/rakuten-credit-risk-surges-after-yen-bond-offering-scrapped</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 02:23:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>印度反人工智能股票交易面临高估值和全球关税风险</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/india-s-anti-ai-stock-trade-confronts-rich-valuations-global-tariff-risks</link><description>与此同时，印度银行系统的现金紧缩迫使贷方以更高的成本借款。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/india-s-anti-ai-stock-trade-confronts-rich-valuations-global-tariff-risks'&gt;印度反人工智能股票交易面临高估值和全球关税风险&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：India’s Anti-AI Stock Trade Confronts Rich Valuations, Global Tariff Risks&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/india-s-anti-ai-stock-trade-confronts-rich-valuations-global-tariff-risks</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 02:30:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>台湾股市暴跌 8%，黄仁勋的提振迅速消退</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/jensen-huang-boost-fades-fast-as-taiwan-stocks-tumble-8</link><description>随着投资者重新关注全球人工智能行业的担忧，亚洲股市对黄仁勋职业生涯复兴的热情在周三迅速消失。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/jensen-huang-boost-fades-fast-as-taiwan-stocks-tumble-8'&gt;台湾股市暴跌 8%，黄仁勋的提振迅速消退&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Jensen Huang Boost Fades Fast as Taiwan Stocks Tumble 8%&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/jensen-huang-boost-fades-fast-as-taiwan-stocks-tumble-8</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 02:45:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着人工智能贸易衰退、石油价格下跌，股票损失加剧：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>由于对人工智能繁荣持久性的怀疑导致科技股撤退，股市延续跌势，期货进一步走软。国债因避险需求而上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;随着人工智能贸易衰退、石油价格下跌，股票损失加剧：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stock Losses Build as AI Trade Falters, Oil Drops: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>